<title>POLAND: Optimus to list 2.1 mln shrs July 3.</title>
<headline>Optimus to list 2.1 mln shrs July 3.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish bourse will list 2,077,153 shares from the $30 million convertible bond issue of computer maker Optimus SA on July 3, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The 300 bonds, all of which have been ordered converted, were exchangeable into 6,947 common shares at $14.76 a share.</p>
<p>Optimus currently has 2.4 million shares traded on the bourse.</p>
<p>The completion of the bond conversion puts the firm's number of shares outstanding at 6,484,108.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
